                                                "sense_id": "a0b5093e-0cc0-331f-b26e-f10e2b24da69",
                                                "text": "The juice after it leaves the mill has a more or less green color, due to the presence of large quantities of chlorophyl and other vegetable substances, which must be removed. This process is known as defecation."
                                            }
